OL,3,AMore than 850,000 households without
OL,4,Apower in Alabama, Florida and Georgia
OL,5,Aafter Hurricane Isaias makes landfall
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 850,000 properties are
OL,8,Fwithout power in Alabama, Georgia and
OL,9,FFlorida after Hurricane Isaias made
OL,10,Flandfall on Friday
OL,12,FA state of emergency has been issued in
OL,13,Fall three states and one woman has been
OL,14,Fkilled after a tree fell on a house in
OL,15,FFlorida, the Escambia County sheriff
OL,16,Fsays
OL,18,FAlthough the centre of the storm has
OL,19,Fmoved away from Florida, Governor Ron
OL,20,FDeSantis says "the threat of flooding
OL,21,Fremains"
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
