OL,3,AMore than 850,000 households without
OL,4,Apower in Alabama, Florida and Georgia
OL,5,Aafter Hurricane Isaias makes landfall
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe storm peaked as a category three
OL,8,Fhurricane but was downgraded as it
OL,9,Fapproached the shore with maximum
OL,10,Fsustained winds of 105mph
OL,12,FIn addition to Isaias, Tropical Storm
OL,13,FRachel will impact southern California
OL,14,Fon Saturday, and Hurricane Simon will
OL,15,Fhit the Pacific coast of Mexico on
OL,16,FSunday
